# Shared model of cuts_monitor_points/ (INCLUDEd). Units: mm, N, tonne. Plate
# A (4 x 2 CQUAD4, x 0 to 40, y 0 to 20, clamped at x = 0) and plate B (4 x 2
# CQUAD4, x 41 to 81) are joined across the gap x 40 to 41 by an RBE2 (row y =
# 0), an RBE3 (row y = 10, legs on three A grid points), six MPC equations
# (row y = 20, set 50), a CELAS2 and a CBUSH1D (row y = 10): grid point 10 (x
# 40, y 10) and 15 (x 40, y 20) carry two connections each. Plate C (2 CQUAD4
# below A, y -20 to -10) hangs on A only through RBE2 61.
